      <chord name="Dm/A"/>While <chord name="F/C"/>shepherds <chord name="Bb"/>watched their <chord name="C"/>flocks <chord name="F/C"/>by <chord name="C"/>night,<br/>
      <chord name="Dm"/>All seated <chord name="C"/>onthe ground,<br/>
