      <chord name="Am"/>And <chord name="C"/>this <chord name="Dm/A"/>shall <chord name="Bb"/>be <chord name="C/G"/>the <chord name="Dm/A"/>sign:
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v4">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Dm/A"/>&quot;The <chord name="F/C"/>heavenly <chord name="Bb"/>Babe you <chord name="C"/>there <chord name="F/C"/>shall <chord name="C"/>find<br/>
      <chord name="Dm"/>To human <chord name="C"/>view displayed,<br/>
