      <chord name="Am"/>And <chord name="C"/>in <chord name="Dm/A"/>a <chord name="Bb"/>manger <chord name="Dm/A"/>laid.&quot;
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v5">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Dm/A"/>Thus <chord name="F/C"/>spake <chord name="C"/>the <chord name="Dm/A"/>seraph; <chord name="F/C"/>and forth <chord name="C"/>with<br/>
      <chord name="Dm"/>Appeared a <chord name="C"/>shining throng<br/>
      <chord name="F/C"/>Of <chord name="Bb"/>angels praising <chord name="C"/>God <chord name="Dm/A"/>on <chord name="Am"/>high,<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Who <chord name="C"/>thus <chord name="Dm/A"/>addressed <chord name="C/G"/>their <chord name="Dm/A"/>song:
